ard meetings, job fairs, receptions, conferences, student thesis shows, and academic lectures. <br /> The University Gallery also provides a place to showcase artwork from RIT's extensive archives, support the work of professional Alumni, and display expert traveling exhibitions. The rotating shows in the Gallery are comprised of works that inspire creativity and spark imagination in today's RIT students.","UNI",[6572],{"_81":6573,"_82":6574,"_43":6567,"_83":6566},"University Gallery","https://maps.rit.edu/pictures/007a_uni_universitygallery.jpg",{"_41":6758,"_43":6200,"_45":6759,"_67":6760,"_47":6761,"_49":403,"_51":52,"_53":6758,"_55":6762},{"_30":86,"_37":6577},[6578],[6579,6580,6581,6582,6583,6584,6585,6586,6587,6588,6589,6590,6591,6592,6593,6594,6595,6596,6597,6598,6599,6600,6601,6602,6603,6604,6605,6606,6607,6608,6609,6610,6611,6612,6613,6614,6615,6616,6617,6618,6619,6620,6621,6622,6623,6624,6625,6626,6627,6628,6629,6630,6631,6632,6633,6634,6635,6636,6637,6638,6639,6640,6641,6642,6643,6644,6645,6646,6647,6648,6649],[390,6650],[390,6757],[390,6756],[6754,6755],[6752,6753],[6657,6751],[6750,702],[6748,6749],[6747,5315],[6745,6746],[6743,6744],[6741,6742],[1628,6738],[6739,6740],[6737,6738],[6735,6736],[6734,5892],[6698,6733],[6731,6732],[6730,5315],[6728,6729],[6726,6727],[6725,771],[6724,5392],[6708,5856],[6710,6723],[6721,6722],[6719,6720],[6716,6718],[6716,6717],[6714,6715],[6712,6713],[6710,6711],[6708,6709],[6707,6668],[6705,6706],[6703,6704],[6701,6702],[6699,6700],[6698,6685],[6697,6687],[6696,6691],[1626,381],[6694,6695],[6692,6693],[6692,6691],[6690,6691],[1623,6689],[6688,6689],[6686,6687],[6684,6685],[6682,6683],[6681,383],[6679,6680],[6677,6678],[883,6676],[6674,6675],[886,6673],[6671,6672],[6669,6670],[6667,6668],[6665,6666],[6663,6664],[6661,6662],[6659,6660],[6657,6658],[6655,6656],[6653,6654],[6651,6652],[6651,6650],[390,6650],43.083198,-77.680052,43.083221,-77.68005,43.083234,-77.680048,43.083242,-77.680045,43.083248,-77.680042,43.083257,-77.680